{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "a-note-from-phainon",
  "name": "A Note from Phainon",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/A_Note_from_Phainon",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-23T09:23:41.138Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To my friend (Trailblazer),"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b6b91ec08c15c338"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"A hero once set his own flesh and blood ablaze, forging a longsword to cleave the darkness.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Back in the wheat fields of Aedes Elysiae, my mother told me this nursery rhyme when I was young."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "She said that the hero never really died and would one day come back to us."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And I believed it with every fiber of my being."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-280d01e7a9b0dbd1"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But he never came when raging fires burned the fields to ash."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "He never came when the endless black tide swallowed the world whole."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I have lost count of the hopes I've held, the prayers I've sent."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yet the hand of the clock, dripping with golden blood, reset again and again, leaving tomorrow a dawn that will never break."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f0c9e85bf5ecff1b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When dawn fell to earth, it was you who showed me the way forward."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It was you who shouldered the weight of countless Coreflames for me."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It was you who saved me from the hell built of withered bones,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and wrote a new tomorrow for Amphoreus."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-24812095629abd92"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It was you... the hero I've been waiting for."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And it was also you who showed me that I, too, could become the hero within."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To forge my own destiny, just like you."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-18cbd8456ea1f6cc"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Please accept this creation forged in the same furnace as the Dawnmaker, proof of our battles fought side by side."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A nameless mass of molten iron, hammered by scars and tempered in suffering, spinning through countless cycles of time,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "finally taking shape under your gaze."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5cdd76e5a10855e4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "May it give you the courage to believe in the arrival of dawn,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "my hero."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-4694c4a1937b8d30"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Phainon"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b1571864e54113b2"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
